@memory_only struct LockGuard[lock_origin: MutOrigin] Owns one structural-change lock until destruction.
Moving transfers ownership without acquiring another lock. Copying acquires a distinct lock that is released independently. Because the Copyable trait cannot report errors, copying aborts if no lock is available. Acquire a guard before constructing a value that needs protection during initialization, then transfer it into the owning container, such as LockedEntityRange.

