@memory_only struct BitPool Pool of reusable bit indices.
BitPool hands out unique bit indices in the range 0..<capacity and recycles returned indices for later reuse. Recycled indices are stored as an implicit singly linked free list inside _bits, so allocation and recycling are O(1).

