@memory_only struct ResourceDeviceCache Reuses allocations for one source type on one world’s device queue.
Adapter transfers must use this cache’s staging helpers. A slot identifies one contiguous allocation; nonnegative slots belong to the adapter. Slot -1 is reserved by Larecs for the view descriptor. Contents are refreshed on every run unless the world reuses device copies (decision 0021) and the source is unchanged; then Larecs skips preparation entirely. Mutable adapted resources are prepared on every run (decision 0022).

